msgid "Problems while entering or editing cell contents."
msgstr "Problem när cellinnehåll skrivs in eller redigeras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:362
msgid "import/export Applix"
msgstr "Import/export av Applix-filer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:363
msgid ""
"Problems opening or saving a file to the file format used by the Applix "
"spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"Problem när filer öppnas eller sparas i filformatet som används av "
"kalkylprogrammet Applix."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:367
msgid "import/export HTML"
msgstr "Import/export av HTML"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:368
msgid "Problems opening or saving a file to the HTML or LaTeX file formats."
msgstr "Problem när filer öppnas eller sparas i HTML- eller LaTeX-format."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:372
msgid "import/export MS Excel (tm)"
msgstr "Import/export av Microsoft Excel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:373
msgid ""
"Problems opening or saving a file to any of the various file formats used by"
" the Microsoft Excel spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"Problem när filer öppnas eller sparas i något av filformaten för "
"kalkylprogrammet Microsoft Excel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:377
msgid "import/export OOo / OASIS"
msgstr "Import/export av OOo/OASIS"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:378
msgid ""
"Problems opening or saving a file to the OASIS file format used by "
"OpenOffice.Org Calc or Star Office Calc."
msgstr ""
"Problem när filer öppnas eller sparas i OASIS-filformatet som används av "
"OpenOffice.org Calc eller StarOffice Calc."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:382
msgid "import/export Text"
msgstr "Import/export av text"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:383
msgid ""
"Problems opening or saving a file to a text file format including tab, comma"
" and space delimited files."
msgstr ""
"Problem när filer öppnas eller sparas i textformat, till exempel filer med "
"tabb-, komma- eller blankstegsavgränsare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:388
msgid ""
"Problems encountered during <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"installation."
msgstr "Problem vid installation av <application>Gnumeric</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:392
msgid "Main System"
msgstr "Huvudsystemet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:393
msgid "This component is no longer used."
msgstr "Den här komponenten används inte längre."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:397
msgid "Problems encountered when printing a worksheet."
msgstr "Problem vid utskrift av kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:400
msgid "Sheet Objects"
msgstr "Bladobjekt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:401
msgid ""
"Problems with any images, widgets, or drawing elements added to a worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Problem med bilder, widgetar eller ritobjekt som lagts till i ett "
"kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:414
msgid "The Severity and Priority of the Problem"
msgstr "Problemets allvarlighetsgrad och prioritet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:416
msgid ""
"The severity level indicates the seriousness of the problem and the priority"
" level indicates the desire of the developers to address the bug. These "
"fields are used mostly by the developers and should both be left as "
"\"normal\" unless the user has a good reason to change them."
msgstr ""
"Allvarlighetsgraden anger hur allvarligt problemet är och prioriteten hur "
"angelägna utvecklarna är att åtgärda det. Fälten används främst av "
"utvecklarna och bör lämnas på ”normal” om du inte har goda skäl att ändra "
"dem."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:424
msgid ""
"There are two cases when the user should change the severity of the report. "
"In the first case, if the user has a problem which causes "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> to crash (to suddenly disappear or stop "
"working) or a problem in which data is lost, the severity should be set to "
"\"critical\". In the second case, if the user has a report about a desired "
"feature, the severity should be set to \"enhancement\" so the developers "
"will know right away that the desired functionality has not yet been added "
"to the program."
msgstr ""
"Ändra allvarlighetsgraden i två fall. Om problemet får "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> att krascha (plötsligt avslutas eller "
"slutar fungera) eller leder till dataförlust väljer du ”kritisk”. Om du "
"föreslår en funktion väljer du ”förbättring”, så att utvecklarna ser direkt "
"att funktionen ännu inte finns i programmet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:436
msgid "The problem severity levels are explained below."
msgstr "Nedan beskrivs nivåerna för problemets allvarlighetsgrad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:440
msgid "Problem Severity"
msgstr "Allvarlighetsgrad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:444
msgid "Severity Level"
msgstr "Nivå"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:450
msgid "blocker"
msgstr "blockerande"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:451
msgid ""
"The level used to indicate a problem which must be fixed before any next "
"release."
msgstr "Nivån för problem som måste lösas före nästa utgåva."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:456
msgid ""
"The level used to indicate a very important problem such as a program crash "
"or loss of data."
msgstr ""
"Nivån för mycket allvarliga problem, till exempel programkrascher eller "
"dataförlust."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:460
msgid "major"
msgstr "allvarlig"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:461
msgid ""
"The level used to indicate a severe problem but one that does not cause a "
"crash or loss of data."
msgstr ""
"Nivån för allvarliga problem som inte orsakar en krasch eller dataförlust."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:466
msgid "The level to use by default and used for the majority of reports."
msgstr "Nivån som används som standard och för de flesta rapporterna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:470
msgid "minor"
msgstr "mindre"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:471
msgid ""
"The level used for problems which do not affect the functioning of the "
"program."
msgstr "Nivån för problem som inte påverkar programmets funktion."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:475
msgid "trivial"
msgstr "obetydlig"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:476
msgid ""
"The level used to report typos, aesthetic, and other very small problems."
msgstr "Nivån för stavfel, utseendeproblem och andra mycket små fel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:480
msgid "enhancement"
msgstr "förbättring"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:481
msgid ""
"These are reports which are requests for future improvements of the program."
msgstr "Förslag på framtida förbättringar av programmet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:488
msgid ""
"The priority level should be left at the \"normal\" level since this is a "
"field used by the developers themselves."
msgstr ""
"Låt prioriteten stå kvar på ”normal”, eftersom det är ett fält som "
"utvecklarna själva använder."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:499
msgid "The Version of Gnumeric and GNOME"
msgstr "Version av Gnumeric och GNOME"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:501
msgid ""
"The version field is used to indicate the version of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> which was used when the problem "
"occurred. If the problem occurs with several versions, the most recent "
"version number should be used. The version number can be obtained by opening"
" the <interface>\"About Gnumeric\"</interface> dialog using the "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu and the <guimenuitem>About</guimenuitem> menu "
"item."
msgstr ""
"I versionsfältet anger du vilken version av "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> som användes när problemet uppstod. Om "
"problemet finns i flera versioner anger du det senaste versionsnumret. Du "
"hittar versionsnumret genom att öppna dialogrutan <interface>Om "
"Gnumeric</interface> via menyn <guimenu>Hjälp</guimenu> och menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Om</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:511
msgid ""
"The \"GIT\" version refers to a version which the user has recently obtained"
" from the Git revision control repository provided by the GNOME project."
msgstr ""
"”GIT”-versionen är en version som du nyligen har hämtat från GNOME-"
"projektets Git-versionshanteringsarkiv."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:517
msgid ""
"The \"Other version details\" text box can be used to describe any unusual "
"characteristics of the program such as plugins which were added or other "
"uncommon modifications."
msgstr ""
"I textfältet ”Övriga versionsuppgifter” kan du beskriva ovanliga egenskaper "
"hos programmet, till exempel tillagda insticksmoduler eller andra "
"specialanpassningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:523
msgid ""
"If <application>Gnumeric</application> is being used with a GNOME desktop, "
"the version of GNOME being used can be entered in the \"Gnome Version\" "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder <application>Gnumeric</application> med GNOME-skrivbordet kan"
" du ange GNOME-versionen i fältet ”GNOME-version”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:534
msgid "The Type of Operating System and Distribution"
msgstr "Operativsystem och distribution"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:536
msgid ""
"The \"Operating System\" field can be used to describe the underlying "
"operating system being used to run the <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"program. Please note, that if the program is run in an artificial "
"environment such as a virtual machine or a Cygwin setup, this should be "
"indicated in the next field."
msgstr ""
"I fältet ”Operativsystem” beskriver du vilket operativsystem "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> körs på. Om programmet körs i en "
"virtuell maskin eller med Cygwin ska du ange det i nästa fält."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:545
msgid ""
"The \"Distribution/Version\" field should be used to add detail to the "
"operating system described earlier."
msgstr ""
"Använd fältet ”Distribution/version” för att komplettera uppgifterna om "
"operativsystemet ovan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:558
msgid "Other fields and keywords"
msgstr "Övriga fält och nyckelord"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:560
msgid ""
"These fields are used by advanced users to better sort through all the "
"reports. The \"Keywords\" field is used to relate the reports to each other "
"and the \"CC\" field is used by those who are interested to add themselves "
"to those who are notified when changes are made to the report."
msgstr ""
"Avancerade användare kan använda de här fälten för att sortera rapporterna. "
"Fältet ”Nyckelord” kopplar ihop relaterade rapporter. I fältet ”Kopia till” "
"kan intresserade personer lägga till sig själva så att de får aviseringar "
"när rapporten ändras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:572
msgid "Submitting the report"
msgstr "Skicka in rapporten"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:574
msgid ""
"In order to submit the bug report into <application>GitLab</application>, "
"once all of the important fields have been submitted, simply click on the "
"<guibutton>Commit</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"När alla viktiga fält är ifyllda skickar du felrapporten till "
"<application>GitLab</application> genom att klicka på <guibutton>Skicka "
"in</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:581
msgid ""
"Once the bug is committed, a bug report number for this bug will be "
"assigned, and email will be sent either the project maintainer or to one of "
"the other developers which deal specifically with that component of the "
"program. When others take an interest in the bug and add comments or "
"solutions, email will be sent out to the user to inform them of the status "
"of the bug until it is either dismissed or resolved. Bugs can be dismissed "
"if they describe a behaviour that is expected or if they are not deemed "
"important enough to fix."
msgstr ""
"När rapporten har skickats in får den ett nummer och ett e-postmeddelande "
"skickas till projektansvarig eller till en utvecklare som arbetar med den "
"aktuella komponenten. När någon kommenterar rapporten eller föreslår en "
"lösning får du ett e-postmeddelande med information om statusen tills "
"rapporten avvisas eller löses. Rapporter kan avvisas om de beskriver ett "
"förväntat beteende eller om problemet inte anses viktigt nog att åtgärda."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:595
msgid ""
"A user can choose not to be notified when changes to reports are submitted. "
"The user preference page can be accessed <ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"https://gitlab.gnome.org/profile/notifications\">here</ulink> at the "
"following URL. <_:screen-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Du kan välja att inte få aviseringar när rapporter ändras. Öppna "
"inställningssidan för användaraviseringar via den här <ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"https://gitlab.gnome.org/profile/notifications\">länken</ulink>. "
"<_:screen-1/>"
